m","date":"2026-11-02T05:43:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T05:43:57Z"},"message":"fix(workspaces): review round 1 of part 4 (NIW2-602)\n\n- the cloud assignment queue records the account each entry was queued for:\n  another account never sends it, nor sees it overlay its catalog, and the\n  confirmation updates that account's cache\n- a move whose source is synced asks the provider whether the media is\n  evicted before any byte is read, and refuses with \"evicted\"\n- the stranded-take sweep reads the scratch folder as well as .kaipu/tmp/,\n  whatever this launch's detection says\n- the Cloud page section shows an error instead of loading forever, and an\n  older cloudState answer never replaces the latest one\n- SyncStates takes the home folder, so its tests pin the path-rule fallback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"933916441eddf291d9202477561738e05e42c4b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/933916441eddf291d9202477561738e05e42c4b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/a47dea6232026d9fa65442cf986ea624942c82be","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/a47dea6232026d9fa65442cf986ea624942c82be","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/a47dea6232026d9fa65442cf986ea624942c82be","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/a47dea6232026d9fa65442cf986ea624942c82be/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","followin