","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T05:49:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T05:49:57Z"},"message":"fix(workspaces): review round 2 of part 4 (NIW2-602)\n\n- kaipu-media:// never reuses a \"local\" eviction answer: every read is checked\n  for itself, requests within 15 ms share one stat call, and only \"evicted\"\n  is remembered\n- the eviction probe of a Library listing is bounded at 10 s as a whole; a\n  path not answered by then is treated as evicted (a placeholder, no URL)\n- a take recovered from a scratch folder is always placed by rename, even on\n  a launch whose detection missed the provider\n- Edit and Prepare are not offered for an evicted media file\n- a failed cloud-state read drops the previous state, so another\n  workspace's data never shows under this one's name\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"839144fdb1115061af4cb5b474a2c1877ab9c6a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/839144fdb1115061af4cb5b474a2c1877ab9c6a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/77d67e5984be8b1cfd608c4f7c3b2bd80907ec80","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/77d67e5984be8b1cfd608c4f7c3b2bd80907ec80","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/77d67e5984be8b1cfd608c4f7c3b2bd80907ec80","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/77d67e5984be8b1cfd608c4f7c3b2bd80907ec80/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/foll