istian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T05:55:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T05:55:03Z"},"message":"fix(workspaces): the eviction probe's deadline is a hard bound (NIW2-602)\n\nEvery stat call and every fallback lstat waits at most for what is left of the\n10 s budget; what is unanswered then reads as evicted. The EvictionCache test\nnow checks that an evicted answer past its TTL is asked again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df8dbfa4734455752f6dc927ee0966110160c167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/df8dbfa4734455752f6dc927ee0966110160c167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/4ed15804fdbadcfb190dffac10c49224ff03538e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/4ed15804fdbadcfb190dffac10c49224ff03538e","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/4ed15804fdbadcfb190dffac10c49224ff03538e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/4ed15804fdbadcfb190dffac10c49224ff03538e/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":